  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and Advocacy for LGBTI-Inclusive Higher Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will foster increased research production on issues related to sexual orientation and gender identity, by conducting research projects, engage in research collaborations, and by improving the access to the archival material in the organization&apos;s custody for researchers, students and journalists. The project will also train and provide material for improved inclusion of LGBTI people in education.</narrative>
  </description>
